    narr:generatedFrom "4a2e5af44505dae82a1f0f0aac97e2348a790a70" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative tracks how [a four-tier ladder seeded by a free interview](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_10) was framed as [behavioral steps rather than paywalls](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_11), with [the interview producing a perspective in a trial account](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_9) and [the user deciding how far to take it](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_12). A stress-test against a real user found [she was classified as a Knowledge-Rich Consumer and Trigger-1 exemplar](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_34), but [the typology conflated AI-fluency with distribution-motion](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_39) — [her \"similar to Pat\" remark named her distribution motion](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_40), and [both are Knowledge Packagers, differing on other axes](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_41). The correction holds [three facts separately](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_47): [her Individual-tier placement is relational, not sales-validated](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_45) — [she doesn't validate Individual pricing](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_49), yet [doesn't invalidate Professional pricing either](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_50). Her actual role — [the single most prolific beta tester](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_54) — is [absent from the perspective today](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_51), prompting [a feedback-capture mechanism](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_72) and [a question about whether the typology itself needs fixing](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_78). A channel thread frames [SMS as a bonus and upsell](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_20) but [carrying fraud and verification maintenance overhead](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_21), with [an enterprise-only leaning](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_46) that [the speaker explicitly declined to make a decision on](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_47) — [the leaning is recorded; it is not yet a decision](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_50). By mid-summer the ladder is live in the market: [fundraising conversations testing whether team and enterprise pricing is too low](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_2), [a pilot paying below enterprise rate with a larger MSA in legal review](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_214), and [a reframing that the enterprise plan is about deployment shape, not enterprise](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_21) — alongside [a B2C turn toward solo builders](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_5) that [the speaker herself marks as a shift in progress](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_5).""" ;
